#: data/desktop/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.desktop.in
msgid "Quai"
msgstr "Quai"

#: data/desktop/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.desktop.in
msgid "RPM Release Tracker"
msgstr "Suivi des versions RPM"

#: data/desktop/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.desktop.in
msgid ""
"Keep RPM packages from GitHub, GitLab or Codeberg releases up to date with "
"dnf"
msgstr ""
"Maintenir à jour avec dnf les paquets RPM publiés sur GitHub, GitLab ou "
"Codeberg"

#: data/desktop/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.desktop.in
msgid "rpm;dnf;github;gitlab;codeberg;releases;updates;repository;"
msgstr ""
"rpm;dnf;github;gitlab;codeberg;releases;updates;repository;versions;mises à "
"jour;dépôt;paquets;"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Keep RPMs from forge releases up to date with dnf"
msgstr "Maintenez à jour avec dnf les RPM publiés sur les forges"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Many projects publish their Fedora packages only as .rpm files attached to "
"GitHub, GitLab or Codeberg releases. Installed by hand, those packages never "
"receive updates."
msgstr ""
"Beaucoup de projets ne publient leurs paquets Fedora que sous forme de "
"fichiers .rpm joints à leurs versions sur GitHub, GitLab ou Codeberg. "
"Installés à la main, ces paquets ne reçoivent jamais de mises à jour."

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Quai turns each project into a small signed dnf repository served on your "
"own machine. dnf, GNOME Software, Discover and rpm-ostree then install, "
"update and roll back these packages like any other Fedora package."
msgstr ""
"Quai transforme chaque projet en un petit dépôt dnf signé, servi sur votre "
"propre machine. dnf, GNOME Logiciels, Discover et rpm-ostree installent, "
"mettent à jour et restaurent alors ces paquets comme n’importe quel paquet "
"Fedora."

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Its window is native on both main Fedora desktops: GTK and libadwaita on "
"GNOME, Kirigami on KDE Plasma."
msgstr ""
"Sa fenêtre est native sur les deux principaux bureaux de Fedora : GTK et "
"libadwaita sous GNOME, Kirigami sous KDE Plasma."

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Add a project by typing owner/repo or pasting its URL"
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez un projet en tapant propriétaire/projet ou en collant son adresse"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "See what it ships before adding it, with clear warnings"
msgstr ""
"Voyez ce qu’il fournit avant de l’ajouter, avec des avertissements clairs"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Updates arrive through dnf, GNOME Software and Discover"
msgstr "Les mises à jour arrivent par dnf, GNOME Logiciels et Discover"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Metadata signed with a key local to your machine"
msgstr "Métadonnées signées avec une clé propre à votre machine"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Works on Fedora Workstation and Fedora Atomic desktops"
msgstr "Fonctionne sur Fedora Workstation et les bureaux Fedora Atomic"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Tracked sources and their update state"
msgstr "Les sources suivies et leur état de mise à jour"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Adding a project after previewing its packages"
msgstr "L’ajout d’un projet après l’aperçu de ses paquets"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.it_yohan.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "First release."
msgstr "Première version."

#: data/polkit/io.github.it-yohan.quai.policy.in
msgid "Manage quai package sources"
msgstr "Gérer les sources de paquets de quai"

#: data/polkit/io.github.it-yohan.quai.policy.in
msgid ""
"Authentication is required to change which projects dnf installs and updates "
"from their releases"
msgstr ""
"Une authentification est nécessaire pour modifier les projets que dnf "
"installe et met à jour à partir de leurs versions"
